# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads from the repository root: the search
# service's image needs search/ and search_service/, and the test run's
# committed files, whose launch report decides whether the answer step may
# run. Everything else, the data and every env file included, stays on the
# machine.
/*
!/search/
!/search_service/
!/data/
/data/*
!/data/reports/
/data/reports/*
!/data/reports/search/
/data/reports/search/*
!/data/reports/search/answer_test*.json
**/__pycache__/
**/.env*
